{"type":"message","id":"a0fca50b","parentId":"22ae7897","timestamp":"2026-03-04T04:20:34.123Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 12:20 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 2/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## Task: Verify High Priority Fixes and UI Optimizations\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/PixelArtEditor\n\n## Context\ncode-agent completed the following fixes and UI optimizations. Please verify everything works correctly.\n\n## Completed Fixes to Verify\n\n### H1: destroy() Method (PixelEditor.ts)\n- Verify method exists and removes all event listeners\n- Check: `grep -A 10 \"destroy()\" src/editor/PixelEditor.ts`\n\n### H2: RGB Validation (PixelData.ts)\n- Verify validation throws RangeError for invalid RGB values\n- Check: `grep -A 5 \"RGB values must be\" src/crdt/PixelData.ts`\n\n### H3: Decoder Boundary Check (Decoder.ts)\n- Verify chunk length overflow check exists\n- Check: `grep -A 3 \"overflows buffer\" src/encoding/Decoder.ts`\n\n## UI Optimizations to Verify\n\n### Toolbar Features\n- Eraser Tool button\n- Brush Size selector (1px, 2px, 4px)\n- Clear Canvas button\n- Grid toggle\n\n### Status Display\n- Cursor coordinates\n- Fill rate percentage\n- Compression status\n\n### Style\n- Modern dark theme\n- Button hover effects\n- Responsive layout\n\n## Test Requirements\n\n1. Run `npm test` - all tests must pass\n2. Run `npm run build` - must compile without errors\n3. Verify TypeScript types with `npx tsc --noEmit`\n4. Check that new UI elements exist in index.html\n\n## Deliverable\n- Test results summary\n- List of verified features\n- Any issues found\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/test-agent/"}],"timestamp":1772598034121}}
