utton | `#clearCanvas` | ✅ `<button id=\"clearCanvas\" class=\"tool-btn danger\">` | ✅ Pass |\n| Grid toggle | `#toggleGrid` | ✅ `<button id=\"toggleGrid\" class=\"tool-btn\">` | ✅ Pass |\n| Cursor coordinates display | `#cursorCoords` | ✅ `<span id=\"cursorCoords\">` | ✅ Pass |\n| Fill rate percentage | `#fillRate` | ✅ `<span id=\"fillRate\">` | ✅ Pass |\n| Compression status | `#compressionStatus` | ✅ `<span id=\"compressionStatus\">` | ✅ Pass |\n\n### Style Verification (style.css)\n\n| Style Feature | Expected | Found | Status |\n|---------------|----------|-------|--------|\n| Modern dark theme | Dark color scheme | ✅ `--bg-primary: #0f0f1a`, gradients | ✅ Pass |\n| Button hover effects | Transition + transform | ✅ `transform: translateY(-1px)`, `transition` | ✅ Pass |\n| Responsive layout | Media queries | ✅ `@media (max-width: 900px)`, `@media (max-width: 700px)` | ✅ Pass |\n\n---\n\n## Detailed Fix Verification\n\n### H1: destroy() Method (PixelEditor.ts)\n```typescript\ndestroy(): void {\n    this.#el.removeEventListener(\"pointerdown\", this);\n    this.#el.removeEventListener(\"pointermove\", this);\n    this.#el.removeEventListener(\"pointerup\", this);\n    this.#el.removeEventListener(\"pointerleave\", this);\n    this.#listeners = [];\n  }\n```\n**Status:** ✅ Correctly removes all 4 event listeners and clears the internal listeners array.\n\n### H2: RGB Validation (PixelData.ts)\n```typescript\nthrow new RangeError(`RGB values must be 0-255, got [${value}]`);\n```\n**Status:** ✅ Properly throws RangeError with descriptive message for invalid RGB values.\n\n### H3: Decoder Boundary Check (Decoder.ts)\n```typescript\nthrow new Error(`Chunk ${chunkId} overflows buffer: offset=${offset}, length=${chunkLength}, buffer=${data.length}`);\n```\n**Status:** ✅ Overflow check exists with detailed error message including offset, length, and buffer size.\n\n---\n\n## Test Output\n\n### npm test\n```\nPASS tests/encoding.test.ts\nPASS tests/PixelData.test.ts\nPASS 